# Maintainer-only, in two private repos nested inside this one:
#
#   release/   letterofmarque/release   — release tooling; useless without push
#              rights to the tags, the split workflow and Packagist
#   project/   letterofmarque/project   — operating docs, plans, Claude skills
#
# Both are real git repos, so they are versioned — just not here. The entries
# below them are symlinks INTO project/, which is why the paths still appear:
# the link is ignored, the target lives in the private repo.
#
# Public-facing docs (upgrade guides, integration, new-package) stay tracked
# at docs/ root. Anything internal does not.
release/
project/
